           "body": "A Payment from Xero cannot be matched against an Order in Infusionsoft. The Payment amount exceeded the Order Total due amount.\n\nPayment details:\nContact: #{_('data.xero.updated_payment.Invoice.Contact.Name')}\nDate: #{_('data.xero.updated_payment.Date')}\nPayment amount: #{_('data.xero.updated_payment.Amount')}\n--------------------------------------------------------\nThis Payment from Xero was matched against the following Infusionsoft Order : \n\nInfusionsoft invoice ID: #{_('data.infusionsoft.get_invoice.Id')}\nInfusionsoft invoice amount due is less than payment made of #{_('data.xero.updated_payment.Amount')}.\n\nPlease check on this record and edit accordingly. Then, re-run the job if you wish to try again.\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\nThis is an automated notification email sent by Workato Integration App recipe. To stop receiving emails like this, please log in to your Workato account and turn Email notifications off on your recipe.\n\nJob ID : #{_('data.workato.job_context.job_id')}\nJob URL : #{_('data.workato.job_context.job_url')}\nRecipe URL : #{_('data.workato.job_context.recipe_url')}\nJob Created At : #{_('data.workato.job_context.job_created_at')}\n"
          },
          "uuid": "9e4ff06e-5c32-40de-b497-513f388143ed",
          "title": null,
          "description": null
         },
         {
          "number": 10,
          "keyword": "filter",
